# LightFringe source snapshot: historical 48 paths plus reviewed explicit additions; not staging permission.
# Root-relative exceptions use approved spelling and preserve package/fixture paths.
# The separate SHA-bound allowlist controls file type, exact case, identity and staging.
# Ignore rules do not untrack files and cannot prevent forced staging.
# Lower-level ignore files, attributes and content filters require separate verification.
#
# Default deny applies at every depth, including unknown environment/directory names.
# Do not replace it with broad !*.py, !lightfringe/** or !artifacts/** exceptions.
*

